This software (the "ShipMind Prototype") is provided as supplementary
material for the academic paper "Impact of Technostress on Seafarer
Wellbeing: Survey Insights and Mitigation Strategies" submitted to
IAMUC 2026.


PERMITTED USE

You are permitted to:
  - Download and install the application for the purpose of academic
    review, evaluation, and non-commercial research.
  - Reference the application in academic work with appropriate citation
    to the corresponding paper.


